    "chunk_text": "Be witena ger\u00e6dnessan. \u00deis syndan \u00fea ger\u00e6dnessa, \u00fee Engla r\u00e6dgifan gecuran & gecw\u00e6dan & geornlice l\u00e6rdan, \u00fe\u00e6t man & \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6ra biscpa frumr\u00e6d, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle fram synnum georne gecyrran, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee we don & witena ger\u00e6dnes is, \u00fe\u00e6t abbodas & abbodissan heora agen lif rihtlice fadian & eac heora heorda & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lces hades men georne gebugan for Gode & for worolde, \u00e6lc to \u00feam rihte \u00fee him to gebyrige. & huru\u00feinga Godes \u00feeowas biscpas & abbodas, munecas & mynecena, canonicas & nunnan to rihte & witena ger\u00e6dnes is, \u00fe\u00e6t muneca gehwilc, \u00fee ute of mynstre sy, & regoles ne gyme, do swa him \u00feearf gebuge georne into mynstre mid eallum ea\u00f0mettum & misd\u00e6da geswice & bete swy\u00fee georne \u00fe\u00e6t he & se munuc, \u00fee mynster n\u00e6bbe, cume to scirebiscop & trywsige hine sylfne wi\u00f0 God & wi\u00f0 men, \u00fe\u00e6t & gif he \u00fe\u00e6t gel\u00e6ste, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 he weor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man \u00fee bet healde, wunige \u00fe\u00e6r he wunige. & canonicas, \u00fe\u00e6r seo ar sy, \u00fe\u00e6t hy beodern & sl\u00e6pern habban magan, healdan heora mynster mid & ealle Godes \u00feeowas, & huru\u00feinga sacerdas, we bidda\u00f0 & l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hy Gode hyran & cl\u00e6nnesse Fulgeorne hi witan, \u00fe\u00e6t hy nagon mid rihte \u00feurh \u00e6nig h\u00e6med\u00feing wif",
